{"title": "Astral Knowledge: Dexterity", "pageid": 32641, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Astral_Knowledge:_Dexterity", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Astral_Knowledge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp/300px-Astral_Knowledge.webp, /w/images/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp/300px-Astral_Knowledge.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Astral Knowledge: Dexterity</b> is a class action for <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a>. It grants them the ability to gain proficiency in all skills using Dexterity.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/25px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/38px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/50px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acrobatics\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png/25px-Acrobatics_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Acrobatics_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source ima